### ==============================================================================
### VOLEIPLAY BACKEND - ARQUIVO DE TESTES HTTP (REST Client / Thunder Client)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrlGateway = http://localhost:3000
@baseUrlHex = http://localhost:3001
@baseUrlVertical = http://localhost:3002
@baseUrlCqrs = http://localhost:3003

### ==============================================================================
### 1. GATEWAY UNIFICADO (Porta 3000)
### ==============================================================================

### Abrir Dashboard visual no navegador:
### http://localhost:3000/

### Listar Jogadores via Gateway Hexagonal
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players

### Listar Jogadores via Gateway Vertical Slice
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players

### Listar Jogadores via Gateway CQRS + Mediator
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players


### ==============================================================================
### PERSISTÊNCIA POLIGLOTA & CACHING (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis)
### ==============================================================================

### [Bancos] 1. Checagem Unificada de Saúde (Postgres, Mongo, Redis, Elasticsearch)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/status

### [Bancos] 2. Benchmark Comparativo de Latência (RAM vs Disco)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/benchmark

### [Bancos] 3. Cache-Aside Pattern: 1ª Requisição (espera Cache MISS e grava no Redis)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/cache-demo/player/p-1

### [Bancos] 4. Cache-Aside Pattern: 2ª Requisição (espera Cache HIT em <1ms via RAM)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/cache-demo/player/p-1

### [Bancos] 5. Invalidação Manual de Cache no Redis
DELETE {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/cache-demo/player/p-1

### [Bancos] 6. Transação ACID no PostgreSQL (Cenário Feliz: COMMIT)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/relational/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountCents": 50000,
  "simulateError": false
}

### [Bancos] 7. Transação ACID no PostgreSQL (Cenário de Erro: ROLLBACK Integral)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/relational/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountCents": 50000,
  "simulateError": true
}

### [Bancos] 8. Inserir Scout NoSQL Complexo / Aninhado no MongoDB
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/nosql/scout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournament": "Superpraia 2026",
  "teams": {
    "teamA": { "player1": "Alison Mamute", "player2": "Bruno Schmidt", "score": 2 },
    "teamB": { "player1": "Evandro Gonçalves", "player2": "Arthur Lanci", "score": 0 }
  },
  "advancedStats": {
    "aces": { "mamute": 7, "bruno": 3 },
    "blocks": { "mamute": 11, "evandro": 5 },
    "attackEfficiency": { "mamute": 0.74, "bruno": 0.61 },
    "sandHeatmapPoints": [
      { "x": 10, "y": 25, "type": "spike" },
      { "x": 80, "y": 90, "type": "block" },
      { "x": 50, "y": 50, "type": "dig" }
    ]
  }
}

### [Bancos] 9. Listar Scouts de Partidas Salvos no MongoDB
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/database/nosql/scouts


### ==============================================================================
### 2. ARQUITETURA HEXAGONAL (Ports & Adapters - Porta 3001 ou Gateway /hexagonal)
### ==============================================================================

### [Hexagonal] 1. Listar jogadores (com filtro)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players?position=Bloqueador

### [Hexagonal] 2. Obter jogador por ID
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players/p-1

### [Hexagonal] 3. Criar novo jogador
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alison Cerutti",
  "nickname": "Mamute",
  "gender": "M",
  "position": "Bloqueador",
  "skillLevel": 5,
  "height": 203,
  "dominantHand": "Destro",
  "bio": "Campeão Olímpico na Rio 2016 e lenda das quadras de areia."
}

### [Hexagonal] 4. Atualizar jogador
PUT {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players/p-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillLevel": 5,
  "bio": "Biografia atualizada pelo caso de uso Hexagonal!"
}

### [Hexagonal] 5. Excluir jogador
DELETE {{baseUrlGateway}}/hexagonal/players/p-6


### ==============================================================================
### 3. VERTICAL SLICE ARCHITECTURE (Porta 3002 ou Gateway /vertical)
### ==============================================================================

### [Vertical Slice] 1. Listar jogadores
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players?search=Duda

### [Vertical Slice] 2. Obter jogador por ID
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players/p-2

### [Vertical Slice] 3. Criar jogador na fatia vertical
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno Schmidt",
  "nickname": "Mágico",
  "gender": "M",
  "position": "Defensor",
  "skillLevel": 5,
  "height": 185,
  "dominantHand": "Destro",
  "bio": "Campeão Olímpico Rio 2016 e mestre da leitura defensiva."
}

### [Vertical Slice] 4. Atualizar jogador na fatia vertical
PUT {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players/p-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "Ana Patrícia Paredão",
  "skillLevel": 5
}

### [Vertical Slice] 5. Excluir jogador na fatia vertical
DELETE {{baseUrlGateway}}/vertical/players/p-5


### ==============================================================================
### 4. CQRS COM MEDIATOR (Commands & Queries - Porta 3003 ou Gateway /cqrs)
### ==============================================================================

### [CQRS] 1. QUERY: Listar jogadores
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players

### [CQRS] 2. QUERY: Obter jogador por ID
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players/p-3

### [CQRS] 3. COMMAND: Criar jogador (Dispara CreatePlayerCommand no Mediator)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Evandro Gonçalves",
  "nickname": "Evandro",
  "gender": "M",
  "position": "Bloqueador",
  "skillLevel": 5,
  "height": 210,
  "dominantHand": "Destro",
  "bio": "Dono de um dos saques mais potentes da história do vôlei de praia mundial."
}

### [CQRS] 4. COMMAND: Atualizar jogador (Dispara UpdatePlayerCommand)
PUT {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players/p-3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Atualizado via Command Handler com logging automático do Mediator!"
}

### [CQRS] 5. COMMAND: Excluir jogador (Dispara DeletePlayerCommand)
DELETE {{baseUrlGateway}}/cqrs/players/p-4


### ==============================================================================
### 5. SAGA PATTERN - TRANSAÇÕES DISTRIBUÍDAS (Porta 3006 ou Gateway /saga)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrlSaga = http://localhost:3006

### [SAGA] 1. Executar Saga com SUCESSO (Happy Path: Cria Lote -> Liquida Batch -> Envia Emails)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/prize-distribution/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-copa-2026",
  "simulateFailureAt": "none"
}

### [SAGA] 2. Executar Saga com FALHA NO BATCH (Compensação T1: Cancela o lote pendente)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/prize-distribution/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-copa-2026",
  "simulateFailureAt": "process_batch"
}

### [SAGA] 3. Executar Saga com FALHA NO E-MAIL (Compensação Completa: Estorna lote, devolve orçamento e notifica)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/prize-distribution/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-copa-2026",
  "simulateFailureAt": "send_emails"
}

### [SAGA] 4. Listar todas as execuções de Sagas e verificar status/timeline
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/executions

### [SAGA] 5. Health Check do Orquestrador
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/health


### ==============================================================================
### 6. MICROSSERVIÇO DE PROCESSAMENTO DE PRÊMIOS (Porta 3005 ou /services/prizes)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrlPrize = http://localhost:3005

### [Prizes] 1. Listar torneios e orçamentos disponíveis
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/prizes/tournaments

### [Prizes] 2. Listar todos os lotes de premiação criados
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/prizes/batches

### [Prizes] 3. Criar lote avulso manualmente (Passo T1 isolado)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/prizes/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-copa-2026",
  "items": [
    {
      "playerId": "p-1",
      "playerName": "Ana Patrícia",
      "playerEmail": "ana@voleiplay.com.br",
      "positionWon": "1º Lugar",
      "amount": 25000
    },
    {
      "playerId": "p-2",
      "playerName": "Duda Lisboa",
      "playerEmail": "duda@voleiplay.com.br",
      "positionWon": "1º Lugar",
      "amount": 25000
    }
  ]
}

### [Prizes] 4. Processar lote avulso em batch (Passo T2 isolado - use o ID retornado acima)
# POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/prizes/batches/SEU_BATCH_ID/process
# Content-Type: application/json
# {}

### [Prizes] 5. Compensar / Estornar lote (Transação Compensatória isolada)
# POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/prizes/batches/SEU_BATCH_ID/compensate
# Content-Type: application/json
# { "reason": "Cancelamento manual por auditoria" }


### ==============================================================================
### 7. NOVA EMAIL SERVICE API STANDALONE (Porta 3004 e Gateway /services/email)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrlEmail = http://localhost:3004

### [Email API Direta] 1. Healthcheck do Microsserviço de E-mail
GET {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails/health

### [Email API Direta] 2. Listar e-mails enviados na caixa de saída
GET {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails

### [Email API Direta] 3. Estatísticas de envio
GET {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails/stats

### [Email API Direta] 4. Enviar e-mail de teste individual
POST {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "aluno@universidade.edu.br",
  "recipientName": "Aluno de Engenharia de Software",
  "subject": "Aula de Arquitetura: Teste da Nova API de E-mail",
  "body": "Este é um e-mail mockado demonstrando o novo backend de e-mails.",
  "type": "SYSTEM_ALERT"
}

### [Email API Direta] 5. Enviar lote de e-mails (Endpoint consumido pelo Passo T3 da Saga)
POST {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails/send-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emails": [
    {
      "to": "ana@voleiplay.com.br",
      "recipientName": "Ana Patrícia",
      "subject": "Premiação Creditada",
      "body": "Sua premiação foi transferida.",
      "type": "PRIZE_NOTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "to": "duda@voleiplay.com.br",
      "recipientName": "Duda Lisboa",
      "subject": "Premiação Creditada",
      "body": "Sua premiação foi transferida.",
      "type": "PRIZE_NOTIFICATION"
    }
  ]
}

### [Email API Direta] 6. Compensar lote (Endpoint consumido pela Compensação C3 da Saga)
POST {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails/compensate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalBatchId": "batch-teste-compensate-01",
  "reason": "Simulação de estorno manual por auditoria",
  "recipients": [
    {
      "to": "ana@voleiplay.com.br",
      "recipientName": "Ana Patrícia",
      "amountToRefund": 25000
    }
  ]
}

### [Email API Direta] 7. Limpar caixa de saída
DELETE {{baseUrlEmail}}/api/emails

### [Email Gateway Proxy] 8. Consultar Stats através do Gateway principal (Porta 3000 -> Porta 3004)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/email/stats

### [Email Gateway Proxy] 9. Listar através do Gateway principal
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/email

### [Resilience] 10. Consultar Estado do Circuit Breaker do Serviço de E-mail
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/email/circuit-breaker

### [Resilience] 11. Resetar Manualmente o Circuit Breaker (Voltar para CLOSED)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/services/email/circuit-breaker/reset


