### 8. OBSERVABILIDADE, TELEMETRIA & ELASTIC APM (Portas 3000, 8200, 9200, 5601)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrlApmServer = http://localhost:8200
@baseUrlElasticsearch = http://localhost:9200
@baseUrlKibana = http://localhost:5601

### [Observability] 1. Verificar status do Elastic APM Agent
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/observability/status

### [Observability] 2. Healthcheck do APM Server (Docker)
GET {{baseUrlApmServer}}/

### [Observability] 3. Healthcheck do Elasticsearch (Docker)
GET {{baseUrlElasticsearch}}/

### [Observability] 4. Listar índices do APM no Elasticsearch
GET {{baseUrlElasticsearch}}/_cat/indices/apm*?v

### [Observability] 5. Lab 1: Simulação de Gargalo com 4 Spans Customizados (Waterfall)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/observability/slow-operation

### [Observability] 6. Lab 2: Simulação de Exceção e Stack Trace Estruturado
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/observability/error-simulation?ticketId=TKT-VIP-42&matchId=FINAL-BRASIL-POLONIA

### [Observability] 7. Lab 3: Gerar Carga de Memória e Event Loop (Métricas de Runtime)
GET {{baseUrlGateway}}/observability/metrics-load

### [Observability] 8. Disparar Saga Feliz (Gera Distributed Tracing com 3 passos)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/prize-distribution/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-telemetria-apm-2026",
  "simulateFailureAt": "none"
}

### [Observability] 9. Disparar Saga com Falha e Compensação (Gera Spans de Rollback Semântico e Erro no APM)
POST {{baseUrlGateway}}/saga/prize-distribution/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournamentId": "tour-telemetria-falha-2026",
  "simulateFailureAt": "send_emails"
}

### [Observability] 10. Consultar eventos de APM salvos no Elasticsearch
GET {{baseUrlElasticsearch}}/apm-*/_search?size=10


